{
  "title": "1: al-Faatehah الفاتحة",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسۡمِ اللهِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِيۡمِ (1)\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful\nاَلۡحَمۡدُ لِلّٰهِ رَبِّ الۡعٰلَمِيۡنَۙ‏ (2)\nAL-HAMDO LILLAAHE RABBIL A’ALAMEENAR.\n(all) praise is (only) God’s, the Lord of the worlds\nالرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِيۡمِۙ‏ (3)\nRAHMAANIR RAHEEM.\nThe Beneficent, The Merciful\nمٰلِكِ يَوۡمِ الدِّيۡنِؕ‏ (4)\nMAALEKE YAUMID DEEN.\nMaster of the Day of Judgement\nاِيَّاكَ نَعۡبُدُ وَاِيَّاكَ نَسۡتَعِيۡنُؕ‏ (5)\nIYYAAKA NA’BODO WA IYYAAKA NASTA-E’EN.\nThee (alone) worship we and of Thee (only) we seek help\nاِهۡدِنَا الصِّرَاطَ الۡمُسۡتَقِيۡمَۙ‏ (6)\nEHDENAS SERAATAL MUSTAQEEM.\nGuide us (O’ Lord) on the right path\nصِرَاطَ الَّذِيۡنَ اَنۡعَمۡتَ عَلَيۡهِمۡ ۙ‏ غَيۡرِ الۡمَغۡضُوۡبِ عَلَيۡهِمۡ وَلَا الضَّآلِّيۡنَ‏ (7)\nSERAATAL LAZEENA AN-A’MTA A’LAYHIM, GHAYRIL MAGHZOOBE A’LAYHIM WA LAZ-ZAAALLEEN.\nThe path of those upon whom Thou hast bestowed Thy bounties, not (the path) of those inflicted with Thy wrath, nor (of those) gone astray",
  "merits": "Surah al-Fatihah is a cure for physical and also spiritual ailments. Without this Surah, even the daily prayers are incomplete. It is indeed a great treasure that has been given to us by Allah (s.w.t.) through the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) and no previous prophet has been given anything like it. This Surah is also known as ‘Ummul Kitab’ and ‘Sab’a Masaani’."
}
